  "summary": "Lowest price from src to dst using at most k stops.",
  "statement": "`flights[i] = [from, to, price]` are one-way flights between cities `0..n-1`. Return the cheapest price from\n`src` to `dst` with at most `k` stops in between (so at most `k + 1` flights), or `-1` if there's no such route.",
